# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Private research workspace
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The private workspace is a SIBLING of this folder, never nested inside it, so
# these entries are belt-and-braces only. Session notes, deep dives, the decision
# log, drafts, referee correspondence and the raw-data vault all live there and
# must never reach a public repository.
private/
../private/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Data — excluded in full
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw data provenance and redistribution rights are unresolved (project charter
# Q4). Derived panels are regenerable from raw plus code by construction, so
# committing them would add ~37MB of bytes that carry no information the pipeline
# does not already encode.
data/**
!data/**/README.md
!data/.gitkeep
*.parquet
*.xlsx

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated output
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Figures and tables are reproduced by `./run_pipeline.sh` from raw data. They are
# also results: the prior iteration of this project kept them out of version
# control ahead of publication, and that convention is preserved here.
output/**
!output/**/.gitkeep

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment and tooling
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OS and editor
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
